            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>In some implementations, a method of enabling positioning of a first mobile device may comprise obtaining a differential angle-of-arrival (AoA) between (a) a first AoA of a first wireless reference signal at a second mobile device and (b) a second AoA of a second wireless reference signal at the second mobile device. The first wireless reference signal is transmitted by a third mobile device, and the second wireless reference signal is transmitted by the first mobile device. The method also may comprise determining a position of the first mobile device based at least in part on the differential AoA. The method also may comprise providing the position of the first mobile device.</p>
            </abstract>
